From: Nick Kennedy <local-experiment>
Subject: [PRIVATE 14/14] bounded immediate Draw ownership and replay diagnostic

Opt-in only; no foveated replacement and no application compatibility profile.
Uses the existing deferred command allocator and GPU-ordered resource copies.

--- /dev/null
+++ b/include/dxmt_replay_probe.h
